{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "label": "NestJS Backend Migration: Contributor Guide", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shared starting point for install, local services, module ownership, and the pull-request checklist. The migration plan is the source of truth for endpoint coverage and phase status."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_apps_backend", "label": "apps/backend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All migrated backend code goes here. Shared infrastructure lives under src/infra (prisma, redis, queue, lock, stellar) and feature code under src/modules."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_legacy_backend", "label": "apps/_legacy/backend", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Old Next.js backend used as a read-only reference. Never edit it or import it, and do not copy the legacy app in wholesale."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_mobile", "label": "apps/mobile", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Do not change the mobile app to hide backend parity problems."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_pijin_core", "label": "packages/pijin_core", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shared Soroban contract package. Coordinate before changing its public API."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_nodejs", "label": "Node.js 22", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "2. Install and prepare the repository", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_postgresql", "label": "PostgreSQL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Required for Prisma feature work. Compose stores data in the named postgres_data volume. Do not point migrations at a non-development database."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_redis", "label": "Redis", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Needed for rate limiting, locks, OTP and PIN state, and queue work."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_compose", "label": "Docker Compose", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Root compose.yaml starts PostgreSQL, Redis, and the Nest backend. The image build context is the repository root because the image uses the root npm workspaces. Compose overrides database and Redis hosts inside the container."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_api_prefix", "label": "/api prefix", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "4. Running the backend", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This guide says the running API uses the global /api prefix. /.well-known/stellar.toml is intentionally outside that prefix. Health, docs, and docs-json are checked on localhost:3000."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_domain_ownership", "label": "Domain module ownership", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "5. How to divide the work", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each contributor owns one domain end to end: controller, service, DTOs, guards, tests, and the migration-plan update. Do not split one endpoint unless both people agree on the service contract. Suggested owners are Auth/OTP/Accounts (phase 2), wallet (phase 3), engine (phase 4), SMS (phase 5), anchor (phase 6), and demo/friendbot (phase 7)."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_api_parity", "label": "API parity rules", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "7. API parity rules", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Preserve method, path, body, query, headers, JSON names and types, status codes, legacy error shape, auth, rate limits, and raw-body handling for signed webhooks. Record any intentional difference in the Decision log before merging."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_schema_freeze", "label": "Prisma schema freeze", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reuse the checked-in schema and migrations. Do not create or edit a Prisma migration during the parity migration. Schema changes happen only after cutover unless the migration plan is changed first."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_high_risk_tests", "label": "High-risk legacy tests", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "8. Testing expectations", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Port concurrency-hardening, engine-retry-classifier, offline-voucher-security, ramp-security, reconciliation, signup-security, sms-delivery, sms-security, and stellar-transaction-manager tests. Keep the default suite deterministic with mocks, fixtures, or disposable services rather than production services."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_hotspots", "label": "Shared merge-conflict files", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "9. Shared-file coordination", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "app.module.ts, main.ts, apps/backend/package.json, and the migration plan collide often. Add a module with the smallest edit. When two branches both touch app.module.ts, merge one first and rebase the other before resolving registration."}, {"id": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_definition_of_done", "label": "Definition of done", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "10. Definition of done", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A domain is complete only when the module starts, every planned endpoint matches legacy behavior, required guards and rate limits exist, tests pass, typecheck and build pass, no secrets are committed, the parity table and change log are updated, and another contributor has reviewed the pull request."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_01_nestjs_migration_plan", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_apps_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_legacy_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_mobile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_pijin_core", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "1. Project map", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_high_risk_tests", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "8. Testing expectations", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_api_parity", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_apps_backend", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "7. API parity rules", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_schema_freeze", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_01_nestjs_migration_plan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_api_prefix", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_apps_backend", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "4. Running the backend", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_api_prefix", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_01_nestjs_migration_plan_api_v2_prefix", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "AMBIGUOUS", "confidence_score": 0.25, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "4. Running the backend", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_compose", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_postgresql", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_compose", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_redis", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/backend-rebuild/02-contributor-guide.md", "source_location": "3. Local services", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_backend_rebuild_02_contributor_guide_hotspots", "target": "docs_backend_rebuild_01_nestjs_migration_plan", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRA